          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "courtney.dickens@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Jun 25 2020 18:13:01 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\">Build and grow<br>\n <span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">without the financial strain.</span></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Every ASC balances a unique set of clinical, operational and financial circumstances. That’s why our dedicated team starts by listening and learning yours. Instead of selling you a pre-determined solution, we tailor a unique solution that will deliver an exceptional experience for you and your patients.</span><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><br>\n</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Building and growing an ASC comes with many financial challenges. We’ll help you navigate them with flexible solutions.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Our ASC business gives you:&nbsp;</span></span><br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Apr 24 2025 22:26:50 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
